WEBVTT

00:04.080 --> 00:05.320
Excuse me.

00:06.340 --> 00:09.730
Princess, it's time to get ready to go.

00:11.250 --> 00:12.460
Very well.

00:15.490 --> 00:17.830
Amyu, I'd like you to do something for me.

00:17.830 --> 00:18.950
What?

00:18.950 --> 00:21.370
I want you to meet my family.

00:21.630 --> 00:22.680
Huh?!

00:24.560 --> 00:27.250
If it's Amyu, I'm okay with that...

00:27.250 --> 00:29.300
What are you talking about?

00:29.300 --> 00:30.430
A marriage proposal?

00:30.430 --> 00:31.870
No, no!

00:31.870 --> 00:32.880
Then, what?

00:33.140 --> 00:36.930
My family's asked me to 
come home for spring break.

00:34.160 --> 00:35.430
Thanks...

00:36.930 --> 00:40.890
My father wants to meet this swordswoman 
who can use all magical elements.

00:41.210 --> 00:42.060
How about it?

00:42.850 --> 00:44.140
Sure, I guess.

00:44.140 --> 00:45.680
Thanks!

00:45.680 --> 00:47.700
Oh, do you want to come, too, Mabel?

00:47.700 --> 00:48.810
Me?

00:48.810 --> 00:54.310
I'm sure my father would love to meet 
the daughter of Baron Crane.

00:54.310 --> 00:55.450
I'll go, then.

00:55.950 --> 00:57.080
Thanks.

00:58.020 --> 00:59.570
Bye, Seika.

01:02.610 --> 01:04.620
I'm not looking forward to it, though.

01:05.160 --> 01:08.110
You really don't want to go home that badly?

01:08.110 --> 01:09.210
No, I don't.

01:09.210 --> 01:12.580
There's somebody really important 
at the mansion right now.

01:13.150 --> 01:16.070
They're the one who wants to meet us.

01:18.000 --> 01:21.640
It's always a mess whenever 
politics is involved.

01:21.640 --> 01:25.800
If you don't want to go, 
it feels like you wouldn't have to.

01:25.800 --> 01:28.190
I can't do whatever I want, you know.

01:28.190 --> 01:32.310
If I stand out too much, I'll meet
 my end the same way I did in my last life.

01:32.830 --> 01:35.240
That's why I'm doing things 
the smart way this time.

01:55.260 --> 02:06.350
<b>The Reincarnation of
the Strongest Exorcist in Another World</b>

03:09.920 --> 03:11.380
Welcome back, Seika.

03:12.240 --> 03:14.230
I made it, Brother Luft...

03:14.230 --> 03:15.500
What happened to you?

03:16.460 --> 03:17.980
I'm a little carriage-sick.

03:17.980 --> 03:19.200
You okay?

03:19.200 --> 03:20.050
Yeah...

03:20.880 --> 03:23.640
Anyway, you look different 
than I remember.

03:23.910 --> 03:26.450
You feel like somebody who's 
heir to a noble title now.

03:26.450 --> 03:28.060
Do I really?

03:28.410 --> 03:31.680
Oh, this is Amyu from my class.

03:31.680 --> 03:34.440
And Mabel, the daughter of Baron Crane.

03:34.440 --> 03:38.500
Hello. I'm Luft Lamprogue, Seika's brother.

03:38.500 --> 03:40.110
Thank you for coming all this way.

03:42.000 --> 03:45.240
Th-Thank you for the invite.

03:45.240 --> 03:48.880
Welcome, everyone.

03:48.880 --> 03:51.460
And welcome home, Seika.

03:51.460 --> 03:53.250
Thanks, Edis.

03:53.250 --> 03:56.940
Um... I'm back, Father.

03:58.190 --> 04:01.220
Welcome back... Have you been well?

04:01.540 --> 04:02.240
Yes...

04:02.240 --> 04:05.770
Yifa, it's been a long time.

04:05.770 --> 04:07.810
I'm surprised how pretty you've become.

04:08.640 --> 04:10.070
Thank you.

04:10.070 --> 04:12.190
Seika!

04:13.680 --> 04:16.150
You're finally back, huh?

04:16.410 --> 04:19.450
You know how long I've waited for this day?

04:23.150 --> 04:25.050
H-Hey, Brother Gly.

04:25.050 --> 04:27.100
Glad to see you're doing well...

04:27.100 --> 04:29.620
Are you having fun in the army?

04:29.620 --> 04:31.790
I sure am!

04:31.790 --> 04:35.580
I didn't think I'd enjoy it as much as I do.

04:35.850 --> 04:37.960
<i>He was so upset about it back then, too.</i>

04:37.960 --> 04:41.920
I much prefer firing off magic spells 
and swing a sword until I vomit

04:41.920 --> 04:44.030
to sitting behind a desk.

04:44.030 --> 04:47.510
Seika, I'm almost grateful to you.

04:47.510 --> 04:48.640
But...

04:49.240 --> 04:52.060
I haven't forgotten the humiliation 
I suffered because of you.

04:52.370 --> 04:54.980
Fight me, Seika!

04:56.890 --> 05:00.770
Hey, is that the middle 
brother who bullied you two?

05:00.770 --> 05:01.560
Yeah...

05:03.180 --> 05:04.550
You!

05:05.620 --> 05:08.660
Fight me instead of Seika.

05:08.660 --> 05:10.740
Huh? Who are you?

05:11.160 --> 05:14.460
Oh, go on and fight her.

05:14.460 --> 05:17.920
She's a lot stronger than I am.

05:18.310 --> 05:21.800
If you win, I'll fight you.

05:22.800 --> 05:24.720
That makes it nice and simple.

05:24.720 --> 05:26.800
Draw that fancy sword at your side.

05:26.800 --> 05:28.560
My real sword against
your wooden one?

05:28.560 --> 05:31.490
It's all I need against an amateur.

05:31.490 --> 05:34.180
Hey, Seika. You be the referee.

05:34.560 --> 05:37.080
<i>Amyu's the hero; she'll win easily.</i>

05:37.870 --> 05:39.000
Fine.

05:40.090 --> 05:43.190
No magic is allowed in this fight.

05:43.860 --> 05:45.860
You're both ready, right?

05:45.860 --> 05:47.950
Now, begin!

05:59.580 --> 06:01.040
<i>Okay, that's that.</i>

06:01.670 --> 06:03.380
Red burns bright!

06:07.680 --> 06:09.470
Okay, I win.

06:09.850 --> 06:12.720
Th-That's cheating! He said no magic!

06:12.720 --> 06:14.890
And when did I use magic?

06:14.890 --> 06:16.510
You tricked me?

06:16.510 --> 06:18.690
A-And you call yourself a knight?

06:18.960 --> 06:22.660
You're allowed to cheat 
all you like on the battlefield.

06:22.660 --> 06:24.020
O-One more match!

06:24.020 --> 06:25.120
No way.

06:25.120 --> 06:27.000
I'd probably lose the next one.

06:27.950 --> 06:30.860
Seika, keep your promise.

06:31.140 --> 06:34.560
I heard you won that martial arts tournament.

06:34.560 --> 06:36.540
Now, duel me.

06:37.510 --> 06:38.830
Fine.

06:38.830 --> 06:39.960
Oh, my!

06:39.960 --> 06:44.590
My holy knight fighting in a duel?

06:45.710 --> 06:50.220
It must be my destiny to witness this.

06:50.220 --> 06:52.020
What are you doing here, Princess?

06:52.020 --> 06:54.720
I told you not to wander around on your own.

06:54.720 --> 06:56.800
It's not my fault!

06:56.800 --> 06:59.740
Everyone left me behind!

06:59.740 --> 07:02.650
Or maybe I left them behind?

07:02.650 --> 07:05.480
Don't cause problems for my men!

07:05.480 --> 07:09.490
Forget that. Now, begin the fight!

07:06.020 --> 07:09.490
Princess, where are you?

07:10.640 --> 07:14.490
Even if there's absolutely nothing 
to be gained from this fight,

07:14.490 --> 07:17.350
it's something that will 
have meaning for you, right?

07:17.350 --> 07:19.370
Are you saying I'm going to lose?

07:19.370 --> 07:20.530
Oh, my.

07:20.530 --> 07:26.670
I could never do something as cruel 
as say who I expect to win the fight.

07:27.250 --> 07:30.410
But isn't there meaning in defeat, too?

07:32.340 --> 07:34.150
Forget it, Seika.

07:35.180 --> 07:38.100
<i>I'm surprised Gly's listening.</i>

07:38.850 --> 07:42.230
Introduce me to your guests.

07:43.730 --> 07:48.750
You're in the presence of 
Princess Fiona Urd Aleglife.

07:51.410 --> 07:53.130
The Holy Princess?!

07:53.780 --> 07:56.280
<b>Episode 10: The Holy Princess</b>

07:59.520 --> 08:01.480
<i>Seika! Seika!</i>

08:02.090 --> 08:05.040
<i>What kind of rank is "The Holy Princess"?</i>

08:05.460 --> 08:07.440
<i>It's not an official title.</i>

08:07.440 --> 08:09.610
<i>They call her that because 
of the way she was born.</i>

08:09.610 --> 08:10.880
<i>The way she was born?</i>

08:11.380 --> 08:16.790
<i>Fifteen years ago, a priestess at a temple 
in the capital gave birth to a child</i>

08:16.790 --> 08:19.090
<i>whose father was the Emperor.</i>

08:19.770 --> 08:22.230
<i>And that child was...?</i>

08:22.670 --> 08:26.020
<i>"The Holy Princess," who bears the blood 
of both a priestess and the royal line.</i>

08:29.260 --> 08:33.130
Hey, what's the Holy Princess 
doing in your house?

08:33.130 --> 08:35.850
I wanted to meet you!

08:37.850 --> 08:40.170
I've heard all about you!

08:40.170 --> 08:43.290
They say you got the top 
scores on your entrance exam.

08:43.560 --> 08:49.580
And not only can you use all four elements, 
you've also got amazing skill with a sword.

08:49.580 --> 08:52.460
Like the hero in the fairy tales!

08:52.870 --> 08:54.630
Th-Thanks...

08:54.630 --> 08:58.160
Red hair and eyes the color of fresh grass...

08:58.160 --> 09:01.060
Just like I saw.

09:01.680 --> 09:04.850
And what my mother must've 
seen in her last moments...

09:07.120 --> 09:08.980
Seika Lamprogue.

09:09.770 --> 09:13.940
I'm grateful to you for 
agreeing to my sudden request.

09:14.260 --> 09:20.390
Not at all. I'm always willing to 
help in any way I can, Princess.

09:23.730 --> 09:25.290
Um, is something wrong?

09:25.540 --> 09:26.640
No...

09:26.640 --> 09:33.340
I'd love to have you as my holy knights, 
but that's not possible, is it?

09:33.610 --> 09:36.740
I'll be staying a few more days.

09:36.740 --> 09:41.180
Would you like to accompany me 
on my way back to the capital?

09:41.180 --> 09:43.470
Yes, as you wish.

09:43.860 --> 09:48.470
Please be kind to me while I'm here.

09:50.230 --> 09:51.690
Good day.

09:59.360 --> 10:02.780
I didn't think the Holy Princess 
had such a demeanor.

10:02.780 --> 10:04.640
I never thought I'd meet her...

10:04.640 --> 10:07.410
Did you know she was here?

10:08.000 --> 10:09.580
Why didn't you say anything?

10:10.690 --> 10:12.100
Well...

10:14.770 --> 10:18.010
If I were to be reborn, 
I'd love to be able to fly!

10:20.720 --> 10:24.850
I'd recommend one of the birds 
that live in the southern forests.

10:24.850 --> 10:26.980
They're beautiful and brilliantly colored.

10:27.270 --> 10:32.940
But if I had the chance to be reborn, 
I'd want to be something stronger!

10:33.620 --> 10:35.150
Like a dragon.

10:35.150 --> 10:39.820
After seeing it up close, a dragon's 
life actually looked pretty tough.

10:40.100 --> 10:41.770
You've seen a dragon?

10:41.770 --> 10:42.450
Yes.

10:42.450 --> 10:47.370
Yifa and I went to Astiria to 
investigate one this last summer.

10:47.830 --> 10:52.500
In the end, we got to be such good 
friends that it let us ride on its back.

10:52.500 --> 10:54.260
That's wonderful!

10:54.260 --> 10:56.410
And you were with him, Yifa?

10:57.180 --> 11:00.300
So? What's the deal with you two?

11:02.270 --> 11:06.100
U-Um, I'm Seika's... 
<i>Master</i> Seika's... servant...

11:06.100 --> 11:08.670
So you just call him "Seika"?

11:08.670 --> 11:10.770
That's so cute!

11:10.770 --> 11:13.750
Take good care of her, "Seika."

11:13.750 --> 11:15.520
Please don't tease me.

11:16.000 --> 11:19.520
So, I've heard the academy values 
magic skill above all else.

11:19.520 --> 11:22.990
They accept commoners and 
servants alike, then?

11:23.280 --> 11:25.990
Did we say that Mabel was born a commoner?

11:26.340 --> 11:30.010
I heard she was adopted 
by the Crane family...

11:30.010 --> 11:32.380
I'm sorry if that offended you.

11:32.380 --> 11:33.710
It's fine.

11:33.710 --> 11:35.910
Oh, I know, Gly...

11:35.910 --> 11:38.460
Have Mabel fight you tomorrow.

11:40.630 --> 11:42.630
No. I don't care about him.

11:44.810 --> 11:46.140
Of course...

11:50.380 --> 11:51.230
Edis.

11:51.830 --> 11:54.000
What is it, Master?

11:54.000 --> 11:56.320
You and I are the only ones 
in the room right now.

11:56.320 --> 11:58.400
You can speak to me normally.

11:58.840 --> 12:03.820
Or are you still angry that 
I sent Yifa to the academy?

12:04.240 --> 12:06.870
That's not what I'm upset about.

12:07.280 --> 12:10.750
I'm upset that you made her a 
servant of that bastard child.

12:11.130 --> 12:13.280
Don't call him that.

12:13.280 --> 12:17.670
He's doing well at school, 
and hasn't caused any problems.

12:18.600 --> 12:21.970
I still find the boy creepy.

12:22.740 --> 12:24.730
I don't.

12:25.120 --> 12:26.930
Seika is a good person.

12:29.140 --> 12:30.480
Is something wrong?

12:30.480 --> 12:34.140
Oh, thank you for helping 
with the matter in Astiria.

12:34.580 --> 12:39.690
Your report was a major topic of 
discussion among certain academics.

12:39.690 --> 12:41.900
Thank you.

12:41.900 --> 12:44.110
What I learned at school paid off.

12:44.620 --> 12:48.280
Is the school still a good place?

12:49.940 --> 12:50.700
Yes.

12:51.290 --> 12:52.300
I see.

12:52.990 --> 12:54.370
Good.

12:54.690 --> 12:57.540
Write home more often.

12:57.540 --> 13:00.460
Y-Yes, Mother.

13:00.710 --> 13:02.410
<i>That surprised me.</i>

13:02.410 --> 13:04.620
<i>She's ignored me my whole life.</i>

13:06.000 --> 13:09.430
"If I were reborn, 
I'd love to be able to fly!"

13:09.730 --> 13:13.810
I'm amazed you were able to put 
up with that nonsense, Seika.

13:13.810 --> 13:16.430
Somebody had to.

13:16.430 --> 13:21.260
True, but I don't like 
that priestess princess.

13:21.260 --> 13:23.460
I'm sure you don't.

13:23.460 --> 13:27.010
But my past wife was like that.

13:27.010 --> 13:29.290
Huh?! Your wife?

13:29.290 --> 13:31.450
Tell me more!

13:32.540 --> 13:33.580
Hey.

13:33.580 --> 13:35.070
Amyu!

13:35.070 --> 13:36.540
You should've knocked...

13:36.540 --> 13:38.710
You're a little too freaked out.

13:38.710 --> 13:42.620
You shouldn't be coming 
to a boy's room this late.

13:43.300 --> 13:47.130
What? You gonna tell me to act more ladylike?

13:47.440 --> 13:51.360
It's too late for that. 
You've already seen me naked.

13:51.360 --> 13:53.680
I-I didn't have a choice.

13:54.560 --> 13:55.810
Just teasing.

13:56.610 --> 13:57.480
So what's up?

13:57.480 --> 13:58.990
Nothing.

13:58.990 --> 14:02.820
I'm just feeling a little exhausted, 
so I came to hang out.

14:02.820 --> 14:06.100
Sorry for not telling you about the princess.

14:06.100 --> 14:07.740
Don't worry about it.

14:08.020 --> 14:12.030
Hey, you decided what you're gonna do 
when you get out of the lower grades?

14:12.880 --> 14:15.440
Will you go into the higher grades?

14:15.440 --> 14:16.910
What about you?

14:16.910 --> 14:20.540
I'm going home to be an adventurer again.

14:21.120 --> 14:23.340
I can't think of any other options.

14:23.340 --> 14:25.960
And I think it's where I belong.

14:25.960 --> 14:26.910
I see.

14:26.910 --> 14:28.440
And you?

14:29.210 --> 14:31.820
In the dungeon where you
suddenly started stripping...

14:31.820 --> 14:33.750
Enough about that!

14:33.750 --> 14:37.460
...I promised I'd go adventuring 
with you again, right?

14:37.460 --> 14:39.620
I'm going to be an adventurer myself.

14:41.000 --> 14:44.970
I-I didn't think you were serious 
when you made that promise.

14:44.970 --> 14:46.780
I was, though.

14:48.280 --> 14:52.200
I don't know much about adventurers, though.

14:52.200 --> 14:56.180
So when we graduate, will you teach me stuff?

14:56.700 --> 14:58.930
F-Fine, I guess.

14:59.780 --> 15:01.880
Then promise me again.

15:02.390 --> 15:04.790
That we'll go adventuring together!

15:05.370 --> 15:07.710
Yeah, I promise.

15:08.110 --> 15:10.800
Okay, Seika. Good night.

15:11.080 --> 15:12.950
Yeah, good night.

15:17.710 --> 15:21.230
Seika, do you still remember?

15:21.480 --> 15:28.600
The reason you got close to Amyu, the hero, 
was to use her power to hide your own.

15:28.600 --> 15:31.390
Yeah, I'm never going to forget that.

15:39.050 --> 15:41.490
And what's that over there?

15:41.490 --> 15:43.170
This city's cathedral.

15:43.520 --> 15:45.100
And that?

15:45.100 --> 15:46.500
That's where you rent carriages.

15:46.500 --> 15:48.060
You understand, right?

15:48.060 --> 15:51.720
She left all her guards behind because she 
says she can't have fun with them around.

15:51.720 --> 15:55.640
If something happens, you and I will 
have to deal with it ourselves.

15:55.640 --> 15:56.940
I know.

15:58.310 --> 16:00.310
What is this?

16:00.310 --> 16:01.520
The market.

16:01.770 --> 16:04.440
There're so many people!

16:04.750 --> 16:07.340
Let's hold hands so we don't get lost.

16:10.020 --> 16:10.650
Hey!

16:11.550 --> 16:12.700
Sheesh...

16:12.700 --> 16:15.420
It's like we're on a date.

16:15.420 --> 16:18.550
You have your position 
to think about, Princess.

16:18.550 --> 16:20.670
Please don't say that.

16:20.670 --> 16:22.080
It's fun.

16:22.080 --> 16:24.460
Oh, I'd like to eat that.

16:24.460 --> 16:26.420
Gly, buy it for me.

16:31.720 --> 16:33.170
Here, for you guys, too.

16:33.170 --> 16:34.360
Thanks...

16:34.970 --> 16:37.680
<i>He's learned to be nice...</i>

16:37.680 --> 16:40.020
You'd better pay me for it when we get back.

16:40.370 --> 16:42.270
Oh, my! What a petty man you are!

16:43.920 --> 16:46.230
I guess we are standing out after all...

16:46.230 --> 16:50.940
Should I have dressed like that?

16:52.480 --> 16:56.300
What should you do if you want to 
get close to someone like that?

16:57.160 --> 16:58.790
Well, in stories,

16:58.790 --> 17:03.200
there're lots of times where two people 
get closer after one saves the other's life.

17:03.200 --> 17:06.460
I've heard of stories like 
that from adventurers, too!

17:06.460 --> 17:09.130
How fascinating!

17:09.130 --> 17:13.310
One saves the other from a hoodlum 
or a monster, and romance blooms!

17:13.310 --> 17:15.430
Does that happen often?

17:15.430 --> 17:17.220
Probably quite a bit!

17:17.220 --> 17:19.060
No, I don't know...

17:19.060 --> 17:20.660
Ridiculous.

17:20.660 --> 17:22.560
What's with you two brothers?

17:23.200 --> 17:27.440
I've always overcome all the 
obstacles in front of me on my own.

17:27.440 --> 17:32.800
So I love the idea of having 
someone come to my rescue.

17:32.800 --> 17:34.780
Right? I totally get it.

17:35.210 --> 17:38.280
In your case, you're likely 
to be the one doing the saving.

17:38.280 --> 17:39.840
Shut up!

17:42.210 --> 17:44.320
Where to next, Princess?

17:44.320 --> 17:46.290
Um, over there!

17:46.290 --> 17:47.840
Are we going somewhere in particular?

17:47.840 --> 17:49.500
No. Just walking.

17:50.610 --> 17:53.570
When are you going to let go of her hand?

17:53.570 --> 17:55.120
My apologies.

17:55.120 --> 17:57.260
No, it's fine.

17:57.480 --> 18:03.430
But stay close to me, because 
there's no telling what might happen!

18:04.390 --> 18:06.480
What are you grinning about?

18:06.480 --> 18:07.690
When did I grin?

18:09.320 --> 18:11.550
Huh? They're building something here.

18:11.550 --> 18:14.230
Let's take a closer look, Seika.

18:14.650 --> 18:16.650
Hey, don't get too close!

18:16.920 --> 18:18.450
It's fine!

18:23.180 --> 18:23.960
Wind Lance!

18:23.960 --> 18:24.870
Create Golem!

18:30.240 --> 18:31.380
Are you okay?

18:31.380 --> 18:33.450
Yes, we're fine.

18:33.450 --> 18:35.620
Nicely done, Miss Top Student.

18:35.620 --> 18:37.800
You, too, Mr. Soldier.

18:38.170 --> 18:40.180
Thanks, you two!

18:40.180 --> 18:42.300
Why didn't you do something?

18:42.300 --> 18:43.480
Were you asleep?

18:43.480 --> 18:46.230
I figured you two would handle it.

18:46.230 --> 18:48.020
Are you hurt?

18:51.230 --> 18:54.170
Thank you, Amyu.

18:54.170 --> 18:55.390
And Gly, too, I suppose.

18:55.390 --> 18:56.610
You suppose?

18:56.900 --> 18:58.640
<i>Did I disappoint her?</i>

19:00.410 --> 19:01.760
Hey, was that an accident?

19:01.760 --> 19:02.660
Are they okay?

19:02.660 --> 19:04.110
Magic?

19:04.110 --> 19:05.540
Who are those people?

19:05.780 --> 19:08.200
We need to get back.

19:08.200 --> 19:10.080
Oh, already?

19:10.830 --> 19:12.440
One moment.

19:15.620 --> 19:17.050
Princess, this is for you.

19:18.680 --> 19:20.080
One moment.

19:20.080 --> 19:21.300
Okay...

19:21.840 --> 19:24.380
At least, until we get back 
to the mansion, I guess...

19:25.040 --> 19:26.430
There you go.

19:27.220 --> 19:29.480
I don't look weird?

19:29.480 --> 19:30.640
You look great.

19:30.640 --> 19:31.830
It's not bad.

19:31.830 --> 19:34.770
I should've brought a mirror.

19:34.770 --> 19:36.230
Phase of earth and metal.

19:36.590 --> 19:37.950
Spell of Quartz Mirror.

19:41.120 --> 19:43.910
I'm glad you like it.

19:43.910 --> 19:46.090
I'll give you something a 
little nicer next time...

19:46.090 --> 19:48.240
No, I like this!

19:48.900 --> 19:50.690
Thank you!

19:50.690 --> 19:54.110
I've never been given a present like this!

19:54.110 --> 19:56.000
I'll treasure it!

19:56.000 --> 19:59.440
You always did use the weirdest magic...

19:59.440 --> 20:01.880
If you broke it up and sold 
the pieces, you'd make a killing.

20:01.880 --> 20:03.150
Quiet.

21:40.320 --> 21:42.030
You're working hard.

21:42.030 --> 21:43.200
You want something?

21:43.200 --> 21:47.240
I can see why the princess chose 
you to be her holy knight.

21:47.500 --> 21:49.750
"Holy knight."

21:49.750 --> 21:53.410
Do you know why her escorts are called that?

21:53.410 --> 21:54.380
Nope.

21:54.380 --> 21:56.500
She spread the idea herself.

21:56.500 --> 21:58.960
It sounds good in the ears of the people.

21:58.960 --> 22:01.670
And makes it easy for bards to write songs.

22:01.920 --> 22:04.470
I wasn't chosen for my skills.

22:04.470 --> 22:06.720
It was because of some plot she has.

22:07.040 --> 22:09.120
She's a politician, 
even if she doesn't look it.

22:09.120 --> 22:11.200
She doesn't seem that way to me.

22:11.200 --> 22:13.010
She might not seem that way, but she is.

22:13.540 --> 22:17.370
She was once forbidden to 
so much as leave the house,

22:17.370 --> 22:19.430
but at some point, she broke free.

22:19.430 --> 22:23.020
And then she became famous 
as the Holy Princess,

22:23.020 --> 22:26.530
and is now even considered a
candidate for the throne.

22:27.690 --> 22:29.400
And that was her doing?

22:29.400 --> 22:30.160
Yes.

22:31.840 --> 22:34.330
She can see the future.

22:34.750 --> 22:35.750
The future?

22:36.170 --> 22:38.660
Is that really possible?

22:38.660 --> 22:39.760
Yes.

22:39.760 --> 22:42.220
Her mother wasn't just some priestess.

22:42.220 --> 22:43.920
She was the Oracle Priestess.

22:44.510 --> 22:49.430
When she was born, her mother spoke the 
prophecy of the Hero and the Demon King.

22:49.810 --> 22:51.460
The Hero and the Demon King?

22:52.450 --> 22:55.100
Do the empire and the 
princess know who they are?

22:55.100 --> 22:56.610
Nope.

22:56.610 --> 22:59.290
But given how badly she wanted to see her,

22:59.290 --> 23:02.020
that Amyu girl must be the hero.

23:02.920 --> 23:06.300
And from the look of it, you knew that, too.

23:07.280 --> 23:09.340
Well, a lot's happened.

23:10.000 --> 23:12.950
And why are you telling me this, by the way?

23:12.950 --> 23:16.220
'Cause she wanted to see you, too.

23:16.220 --> 23:18.840
I figured it wouldn't hurt to tell you.

23:18.840 --> 23:21.870
But don't get too involved.

23:21.870 --> 23:23.540
Are you worried about me?

23:23.540 --> 23:25.290
Hell no.

23:25.290 --> 23:27.760
I mean don't get in her way.

23:28.510 --> 23:32.230
She's got her eye on the 
empire's future, after all.

23:34.970 --> 23:37.270
The empire's future, huh?
